        "node_id": "n_2_73fa29",
        "thought_text": "The error occurs because the code doesn't handle the case where the tandem repeat might extend beyond the original string length. We need to adjust our approach to consider the maximum possible length of a tandem repeat, which is limited by the original string length and the number of added characters.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
