        "node_id": "n_1_82d21e",
        "thought_text": "The previous approach missed considering that the tandem repeat could extend beyond the original string length, as long as the added characters allow for it. The correct approach should focus on finding the maximum possible tandem repeat length within the new string, which is the sum of the original string length and the added characters, without exceeding this limit.",
